        "For an IB or IGCSE student in Sankeshwar, online one-to-one is the only one of the four that reliably puts a person who has taught the actual course in front of the child. Coaching institutes in Belagavi are built around KCET, NEET and the PU syllabus, which they do well and which is not this. A private tutor in town may be an excellent teacher of state board mathematics and still have never read an IB mark scheme, which is not a criticism of them but a fact about where these papers are taught.",
        "Self study deserves more credit than it usually gets. A disciplined Class 10 student can get a long way through IGCSE Mathematics or Business Studies on past papers and the specification alone. What self study cannot supply is somebody marking an answer the way an examiner marks it and explaining why four marks became two. For the Diploma, where internal assessments, the Extended Essay and command-term precision carry so much, working alone usually costs a grade that nobody notices until the results come out.",
