        "Honestly and within limits. The theory, the question technique and the data handling transfer completely to a screen, and in some respects improve, because a tutor can slow down on one unfamiliar graph for twenty minutes in a way a class of thirty never allows. What cannot be moved online is the practical work itself, and we say that at the start rather than halfway through a term.",
